<title>GREECE: Greek 1M ATHIBOR unchanged at 12.86 pct.</title>
<headline>Greek 1M ATHIBOR unchanged at 12.86 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
